      CXL、PCIe IDE、RDMA 与机密计算数据通路
- elementId: intro
  elementType: text
  bounds: [80, 220, 1100, 70]
  content:
    fontSize: 18
    color: $text
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.5
    wrap: True
    text: |
      高性能 memory/fabric data path 如何把 confidential boundary 推出 CPU 本地内存。三篇论文都属于 data-path/fabric substrate，能解释为何需要跨 fabric 建模，但不能单独证明 confidential I/O 安全性。
- elementId: papers
  elementType: text
  bounds: [80, 300, 1100, 300]
  content:
    fontSize: 18
    color: $text
    fontFamily: Inter, MiSans
    lineHeight: 1.6
    wrap: True
    text: |
      <ul>
      <li>DirectCXL — CXL.mem 直接 load/store 远端内存（E1 / Peer-reviewed）</li>
      <li>CXL-Tiers — 硬件 tiering + 软件 VM 性能隔离（E1 / Peer-reviewed）</li>
      <li>ODRP — 可编程 RDMA remote paging（E1 / Peer-reviewed）</li>
      </ul>
- elementId: bottom-bar
  elementType: shape
  bounds: [0, 714, 1280, 6]
  shapeName: rect
  fill:
    type: solid
    color: $primary
